<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BAYERN MUNICH SHOW PROFIT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BAYERN MUNICH SHOW PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>German league leaders Bayern Munich said on Monday they made a net profit of 6.1 million marks ($4.1 million) for the financial year ending June 1996.</p>
</text>
